### Valid task
POST http://localhost:5136/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "title": "Build POST endpoint",
  "description": "Practice creating resources",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "priority": "High"
}

### Invalid - empty title
POST http://localhost:5136/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "title": "",
  "description": "Should fail",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "priority": "Medium"
}

### Invalid - bad priority
POST http://localhost:5136/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 6,
  "title": "Bad priority",
  "description": "Should fail",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

