### Valid PUT
PUT http://localhost:5136/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Updated gym task",
  "description": "Leg day instead",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "priority": "High"
}

### Missing task
PUT http://localhost:5136/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Missing",
  "description": "Should fail",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "priority": "Low"
}

### Invalid priority
PUT http://localhost:5136/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Updated",
  "description": "Should fail",
  "isCompleted": true,
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

