### Complete existing task
PATCH http://localhost:5136/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Mark it incomplete again
PATCH http://localhost:5136/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": false
}

### Missing task
PATCH http://localhost:5136/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}


