### 1. GET all initial tasks
GET http://localhost:5136/tasks


### 2. GET existing task
GET http://localhost:5136/tasks/1


### 3. GET missing task
GET http://localhost:5136/tasks/999


### 4. Filter incomplete tasks
GET http://localhost:5136/tasks?isCompleted=false


### 5. Filter by priority
GET http://localhost:5136/tasks?priority=High


### 6. Combined filters
GET http://localhost:5136/tasks?isCompleted=false&priority=High


### 7. POST valid task
POST http://localhost:5136/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "title": "Finish Milestone 6",
  "description": "Complete ASP.NET Core basics",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "priority": "High"
}


